SELECT e.id, 14, 65.76, 70.24, 'as seen in this bizarre clip in which Secretary of Homeland Security, Kristi Noem.', '如这段奇特的视频所示，美国国土安全部长克里斯蒂·诺姆。', '/æz siːn ɪn ðɪs bᵻzɑːɹ klɪp ɪnwɪtʃ sɛkɹətɹi ʌv hoʊmlənd sᵻkjʊɹɹᵻɾi, kɹɪsti noʊᵻm./', '<span>as</span><span tid="91479">seen</span><span>in</span><span>this</span><span tid="91482" class="highlight highlight-a">bizarre</span><span tid="91483" class="highlight highlight-a">clip</span><span>in</span><span>which</span><span tid="91486" class="highlight highlight-a">Secretary</span><span>of</span><span tid="91488">Homeland</span><span tid="91489" class="highlight highlight-a">Security,</span><span tid="91490">Kristi</span><span tid="91491">Noem.</span>'
