SELECT e.id, 121, 482.06, 486.08, 'So many of them are wanting to come support and like say hi during the race at some point along the route.', '他们中很多人都想来支持我，在比赛路线上某个点打个招呼。', 'soʊ mɛni ʌv ðɛm ɑːɹ wɔntɪŋ tə kʌm səpɔːɹt ænd laɪk seɪ haɪ dʊɹɹɪŋ ðə ɹeɪs æt sʌm pɔɪnt ɐlɔŋ ðə ɹaʊt.', '<span>So</span><span>many</span><span>of</span><span>them</span><span>are</span><span>wanting</span><span>to</span><span tid="81598">come</span><span tid="81599">support</span><span>and</span><span>like</span><span tid="81602">say</span><span>hi</span><span tid="81604">during</span><span>the</span><span tid="81606">race</span><span>at</span><span>some</span><span tid="81609">point</span><span tid="81610">along</span><span>the</span><span tid="81612" class="highlight highlight-a">route.</span>'
