SELECT e.id, 71, 332.02, 338.82, 'A few exchange glances and a feminine urge to plot our entire imagined future together.', '交换了几次眼神，然后脑内少女剧模式瞬间启动，开始幻想我们的一整个未来。', '/ɐ fjuː ɛkstʃeɪndʒ ɡlænsᵻz ænd ɐ fɛmᵻnɪn ɜːdʒ tə plɑːt aʊɚɹ ɛntaɪɚɹ ɪmædʒɪnd fjuːtʃɚ təɡɛðɚ./', '<span>A</span><span tid="116125">few</span><span tid="116126" class="highlight highlight-a">exchange</span><span tid="116127">glances</span><span>and</span><span>a</span><span tid="116130" class="highlight highlight-a">feminine</span><span tid="116131" class="highlight highlight-a">urge</span><span>to</span><span tid="116133" class="highlight highlight-a">plot</span><span>our</span><span tid="116135" class="highlight highlight-a">entire</span><span tid="116136" class="highlight highlight-a">imagined</span><span tid="116137">future</span><span tid="116138">together.</span>'
